    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2022_0057","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Rangi Achterberg talks about negative space and its landlord. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</Description>
